    <string name="how_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="how_steps">1. Paste your API key below and tap Save.\n2. In any app (WhatsApp, Gmail, Messages…), type your message.\n3. Long-press the text and tap Select all.\n4. Tap \"Make Professional\" in the menu. If you don\'t see it, tap ⋮ (more) first.\n5. Tap Replace, and send.</string>

